### local tooling ###
# .codebuddy 只放行 skills（编码规范）与 2026-09 之后的 memory（跨会话上下文）；
# 仓库是 public，往这两处写东西时不要带服务器 IP、密码等凭据
.codebuddy/*
!.codebuddy/skills/
!.codebuddy/skills/**
!.codebuddy/memory/
!.codebuddy/memory/**
# 2026-08 及更早的日志含明文密码与公网 IP，继续忽略
.codebuddy/memory/2026-0[1-8]-*.md
.workbuddy/

